meta {
  name: Declined (restorable list)
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/master/orders/declined
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # Declined — orders this master can still take back

  Orders this master declined that are still `pending`, unclaimed, and were
  declined no longer than the restore window ago (admin setting
  `order_decline_restore_minutes`, default 60). Freshest decline first,
  paginated by 15 (`?page=2`).

  **Response 200:** same shape as the available feed, plus:

  | Field           | Meaning                                                |
  |-----------------|--------------------------------------------------------|
  | `declined_at`   | ISO 8601 — when the master declined the order         |
  | `restore_until` | ISO 8601 — last moment the decline can be taken back  |

  `distance_km` is always `null` here.

  **Errors:**
  - `403` — token has no usable master profile (see `reason`)
}
